reakpoints. The code only pauses when something you choose is true, like the one bad item in a list of ten thousand."},{"id":"i4","start":21.5,"end":27.307,"text":"And finally, rubber duck debugging. Explain your code out loud, line by line, and the bug often shows up before you finish."},{"id":"s1","start":27.407,"end":29.542,"text":"Save this for the next time something breaks."},{"id":"c1","start":29.642,"end":34.083,"text":"If you want skills like this, a few minutes a day, the link's in my bio. It's called Teyro."}],"lip":{"amp":[0,0,0,0.001,0.001,0.184,0.861,1,1,1,1,0.485,1,1,0.948,0.716,1,0.966,0.75,0.493,1,0.964,1,1,1,1,0.999,1,1,0.693,0.64,0.673,0.61,0.5,0.377,0.83,0.975,0.907,0.984,0.94,0.939,0.963,0.851,0.61,0.581,0.943,1,1,1,1,1,0.838,0.522,0.104,1,0.648,0.077,0.27,0.76,0.716,0.479,0.327,0.821,0.524,0.708,1,1,1,1,1,1,1,1,0.828,0.759,0.532,0.268,0.45,1,1,0.959,0.73,0.306,1,0.973,0.893,0.76,0.733,0.887,0.659,0.617,0.487,0.569,0.821,0.817,0.882,0.773,0.88,0.427,0.027,0.002,0,0,0,0.056,0.459,0.974,1,1,0.817,0.903,0.933,0.555,0.367,0.625,0.081,0.007,0.002,0.002,0.468,1,0.516,0.061,0.797,1,0.989,1,0.837,0.773,0.735,0.867,0.62,0.534,0.121,0.165,0.096,0.97,0.593,0.2,0.01,0.001,0.001,0.498,0.527,1,0.995,0.708,0.539,1,1,0.718,0.075,0.803,0.957,1,1,0.976,1,1,0.94,1,1,0.632,0.319,0.034,0.514,0.874,1,1,1,1,1,1,0.404,0.246,0.76,0.898,0.961,1,1,1,0.988,1,1,0.693,1,1,0.959,0.694,0.129,0.192,1,0.913,0.704,0.554,0.815,0.985,0.565,0.068,0.001,0.001,0.007,0.518,0.752,1,0.707,0.396,0.843,0.76,1,0.986,0.589,0.281,0.925,1,0.836,0.826,0.164,1,0.98,0.836,1,1,0.737,0.798,0.281,0.816,1,1,0.857,1,1,1,0.819,0.782,1,1,1,1,1,0.999,0.551,0.642,0.846,0.65,1,0.776,0.875,0.844,0.972,1,1,0.548,0.052,0.311,0.496,1,1,1,1,1,0.875,0.212,0.816,0.821,0.106,0.425,0.654,1,1,1,0.91,0.272,0.01,0.729,0.98,1,0.633,0.052,0.224,1,0.902,0.883,0.08,0.315,0.811,1,0.793,0.208,0.063,0.082,0.005,0.001,0,0,0.341,0.945,0.955,0.711,0.282,0.442,1,0.987,0.69,0.889,0.697,0.386,0.264,0.02,0.001,0.001,0.14,1,1,1,1,0.